mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 2 to 4 players in Online Multiplayer<br></li><li> Local Multiplayer<br></li><li> 9 Powerful Heroes <br></li><li> Different Bot enemies difficulties (Easy, Medium, Hard)<br></li><li> Different Game Modes (Free For All, 1x1)<br></li><li> Over 5 unique levels<br></li><li> Lots of weapons!</li></ul>",
